@startuml 3.5.2 - View Media Package
title Sequence Diagram — 3.5.2 - View Media Package

autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

' === Participants ===
actor "WorkspaceMember" as workspacemember
entity "MediaPackageRepository" as mediapackagereposito
entity "WorkspaceMediaPackageRepository" as workspacemediapackag
control "MediaPackageService" as mediapackageservice
boundary "MediaPackageController" as mediapackagecontroll
boundary "WorkspacePackageUI" as workspacepackageui

' === Flow ===
workspacepackageui -> mediapackagecontroll: GET /api/v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/media-packages
workspacemember -> workspacepackageui: navigates to workspace media package tab
mediapackagecontroll -> mediapackageservice: listAvailablePackages(workspaceId)
mediapackageservice -> mediapackagereposito: findAllByAgencyIdAndIsTemplateFalseAndAvailableToWorkspacesTrueOrderByCreatedAtDesc(agencyId)
mediapackagereposito --> mediapackageservice: availablePackages
mediapackageservice --> mediapackagecontroll: List<MediaPackageResponse>
mediapackagecontroll --> workspacepackageui: 200 OK (availablePackages)
workspacepackageui --> workspacemember: render available agency packages catalog
workspacepackageui ->> mediapackagecontroll: GET /api/v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/media-package
workspacemember ->> workspacepackageui: views selected package details
mediapackagecontroll ->> mediapackageservice: getWorkspacePackage(workspaceId)
mediapackageservice ->> workspacemediapackag: findByWorkspaceId(workspaceId)

alt no package selected yet for this workspace
  workspacemediapackag --> mediapackageservice: Optional.empty()
  mediapackageservice --> mediapackagecontroll: null
  mediapackagecontroll --> workspacepackageui: 200 OK (data: null)
  workspacepackageui --> workspacemember: show informative empty state ('No package selected yet') & prompt Client action
else package already selected
  workspacemediapackag --> mediapackageservice: workspacePackage
  mediapackageservice ->> mediapackagereposito: findById(packageId)
  mediapackagereposito --> mediapackageservice: mediaPackage
  mediapackageservice --> mediapackagecontroll: WorkspaceMediaPackageResponse (status, finalTerms, termsVersion, approvals)
  mediapackagecontroll --> workspacepackageui: 200 OK (WorkspaceMediaPackageResponse)
  workspacepackageui --> workspacemember: render package summary (type, budget/duration, terms version, negotiation status)
end

@enduml
